<http://vocab.getty.edu/historic/current> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Valid/used currently";
                                          a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>,
                                            <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>;
                                          <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <http://vocab.getty.edu/historic/>;
