                                  rdfs:range <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Agent>;
                                  rdfs:subPropertyOf <http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor>.
gvp:contributorNonPreferred <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> """Contributor for which the term is Non-preferred. Range is foaf:Agent.
