gvp:placeTypeNonPreferred <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> """A secondary type for a TGN Place. Domain is TGN concept, range is AAT concept.
Example: A non-preferred type of Machupicchu, Peru is \"Inca center\" (historical)""";
                          a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
