gvp:placeTypePreferred <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> """The primary type of a TGN Place. Domain is TGN concept, range is AAT concept.
Example: The preferred place type of Machupicchu, Peru is \"deserted settlement\" (current)""";
                       a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
