                                                        <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "A term that is used for both the singular and plural in the same language".
<http://vocab.getty.edu/term/POS/Noun> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> """Term is a noun but we are uncertain if it is plural or singular.
